{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.ZMod.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Common"],"declarations":14,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalGenerator_T_relation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalGenerator_T_relation","kind":"axiom","line":184,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L184-L202","doc":"**T-form Hecke relation** (the F_p-friendly form):\n`T_i² = (q − 1) · T_i + q · 1`.\n\nInteger-coefficient when `R = ℤ`: `q − 1, q ∈ ℤ[q, q⁻¹]`.\nReducing mod p (when `R = ℤ` then `R = ZMod p`) preserves\nthe relation since coefficients are integers — making the\nHecke relation hold uniformly across all primes.\n\nAxiomatised pending the concrete algebra structure (the\nIwahori-Hecke port has not yet landed in Mathlib).\nPointwise add `+` on `Fin _ → LaurentPolynomial R` uses the\nnatural `Pi` ring instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalSMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalSMul","kind":"def","line":174,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L174-L182","doc":"**Scalar action** of `R[q, q⁻¹]` on `HeckeFormalElement R n`:\nformal scalar multiplication by a Laurent polynomial.\nCLOSED: pointwise multiplication on the function space. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalGenerator","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalGenerator","kind":"opaque","line":166,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L166-L172","doc":"**T-form Hecke generator** `T_i ∈ Hecke_formal R n`.\nAxiomatised at the type level; concrete construction\npending Mathlib Iwahori-Hecke port. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalOne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalOne","kind":"def","line":158,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L158-L164","doc":"**Formal Hecke-algebra unit** — the multiplicative identity.\nCLOSED: indicator function `δ_{id}` in the group algebra basis,\nplacing `1 ∈ R[q,q⁻¹]` at the identity permutation (index 0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalMul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.heckeFormalMul","kind":"opaque","line":147,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L147-L156","doc":"**Formal Iwahori-Hecke algebra multiplication** over `R`.\nAxiomatised pending Mathlib port of the Hecke generators.\n\nConcrete structure: T-form generators `T_i ∈ Hecke_formal R n`\nwith `T_i² = (q - 1) T_i + q` (relation in `R[q, q⁻¹]`,\ninteger-coefficient when `R = ℤ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_HeckeFormalElement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_HeckeFormalElement","kind":"def","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L132-L138","doc":"**Element-wise F_p reduction** of a Hecke formal element\nover ℤ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_formalQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_formalQ","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L122-L130","doc":"Reduction mod p of the formal variable `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_one","kind":"theorem","line":118,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L118-L120","doc":"Reduction mod p preserves one. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP_zero","kind":"theorem","line":114,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L114-L116","doc":"Reduction mod p preserves zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.reduceModP","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L103-L112","doc":"**Reduction mod p** on Laurent polynomials: applies\n`Int.castRingHom (ZMod p)` coefficient-wise.\n\nMathlib API drift: the coefficient-map ring hom on\n`LaurentPolynomial R = AddMonoidAlgebra R ℤ` is\n`AddMonoidAlgebra.mapRangeRingHom`; the former\n`LaurentPolynomial.mapRingHom` no longer resolves. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQ_mul_formalQInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQ_mul_formalQInv","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L90-L95","doc":"`q · q⁻¹ = 1` in `R[q, q⁻¹]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQInv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQInv","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L86-L88","doc":"The formal Hecke variable `q⁻¹` as a `LaurentPolynomial`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.formalQ","kind":"def","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L82-L84","doc":"The formal Hecke variable `q` as a `LaurentPolynomial`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.HeckeFormalElement","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.HeckeAlgebra.Formal.HeckeFormalElement","kind":"def","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/HeckeAlgebra/Formal.lean#L71-L80","doc":"**Formal Hecke element** over a commutative ring `R`,\nrepresented as a vector of Laurent polynomials in `R[q, q⁻¹]`.\n\nFor `R := ℤ`, this is the canonical integer-coefficient\nHecke element — admits clean reduction to F_p for every p.\n\nDimension uses the same `heckeDim n = n!` count as the\narchimedean form. ","signatureChunk":0}]}